# =============================================================================
# Handloom Admin API — LOCAL development env
# =============================================================================
# Copy to .env for `make setup-local` / `make run`.
#
# Only the vars below need setting locally. Everything else has a working
# default in internal/config (table names, server config, JWT issuer/durations,
# gateway base URLs/versions, OTel, etc.).
#
# This file is LOCAL ONLY. Deployed environments do NOT use it:
#   - non-secret config  → infra/cmd/config.go (per-env)
#   - secrets            → BACKEND_ENV_{DEV,PROD} GitHub secret + AWS SSM
#                          (/handloom/<env>/jwt-secret, customer-jwt-secret,
#                           embedder-auth-key) + MSG91_AUTH_KEY GitHub secret

# --- Required for local dev ---------------------------------------------------

# LocalStack (DynamoDB/S3/SNS). Without AWS_ENDPOINT the SDK hits real AWS.
AWS_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4566
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=local
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=local

# Local Postgres (Docker). No usable default — must point at your catalog DB.
POSTGRES_DSN=postgres://handloom:handloom@localhost:5432/handloom?sslmode=disable

# --- Optional: gateway secrets ------------------------------------------------
# Leave blank to use each gateway's DevClient (fake payments / OTP printed to
# console / no real shipping). Set real values only to test live integrations.

# PhonePe Standard Checkout
PHONEPE_CLIENT_ID=
PHONEPE_CLIENT_SECRET=
PHONEPE_WEBHOOK_USERNAME=
PHONEPE_WEBHOOK_PASSWORD=

# MSG91 SMS / OTP
MSG91_AUTH_KEY=

# =============================================================================
# Seed admin (created by the seed-data script): admin@handloom.com / Admin@123!
# Change immediately after first login.
# =============================================================================
